@startuml Admin Navigation Map

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Financial Reconciliation System - Admin Navigation Map

' Authentication Layer
component "Login Screen\n/login\n\nUC: User Authentication" as Login #FFE0B2
component "Register\n/register" as Register #FFE0B2
component "Forgot Password\n/forgot-password" as ForgotPwd #FFE0B2

' Main Dashboard
component "Admin Dashboard\n/dashboard\n\nUC: System Overview & Monitoring" as Dashboard #D1C4E9

' Admin Panel
package "Admin Panel" #E1BEE7 {
    component "Admin Panel\n/admin\n\nUC: System Administration" as AdminPanel
}

' Navigation Flows
Login --> Dashboard : Admin Login Success
Login --> Register
Login --> ForgotPwd
Register --> Login

Dashboard --> AdminPanel

legend right
    **Screen Types**
    <color:#FFE0B2>Authentication Screens</color>
    <color:#D1C4E9>Admin Dashboard</color>
    <color:#E1BEE7>Admin Panel</color>
endlegend

note bottom
    **Admin View Features:**
    - System-wide statistics (Total Users, Active Businesses, Transactions)
    - User management and monitoring
    - Business growth analytics
    - System health monitoring
    - Recent user activity tracking
    - System alerts and notifications
    - Top performing accountants
    - Platform-wide reports
    - Configuration and settings
    - Security and access control
    
    **Key Differences from Other Roles:**
    - No access to individual business workflows (Invoice Upload, Bank Import, etc.)
    - No access to Reports & Compliance screens
    - No access to Settings & Configuration screens
    - Admin has only Dashboard and Admin Panel screens
    - Focus on system administration and monitoring rather than business operations
end note

@enduml
